      "title": {
        "zh": "会话永久删除",
        "en": "Session delete (permanent)"
      },
      "description": {
        "zh": "在会话菜单里加一项「删除会话」：删掉对话日志、工作区归属、归档/置顶状态与投影缓存。仍打开的会话先隐藏，下次启动时删除日志。另含 session_delete / session_delete_list 两个工具。",
        "en": "Adds Delete session to the session menu: removes the conversation log, workspace membership, archive and pin state, and cached projections. A session still open is hidden now and erased at the next start. Also registers the session_delete and session_delete_list tools."
